{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"會合","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"10fa6bf183ea108d0d53f9e538fe393fb22013a160fe7276b94f7c695306553c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"會合後，羅德島得知米莎被W劫走。在阿米婭的追問下，陳終於說出了米莎的秘密。\n這一次，近衛局決定與羅德島聯手。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你們也不怎麼好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，究竟發生了什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有增援，火力猛烈，近衛局的隊形很快被他們衝散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那米莎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"被一個紅衣服的女人劫走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我真該——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，米莎身上究竟有什麼?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"再繼續隱瞞下去，羅德島與近衛局的合作進程只會越來越艱難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有告知你的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但羅德島有瞭解目標並做出應對策略的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島在行動中會聽從近衛局的指揮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，即便是用感染者去對抗感染者，我們也是需要情報的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局擁有資訊，卻不懂得如何對抗感染者才能減少損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島有對抗感染者的能力，卻不知道整合運動想要什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說的話，有點那個醫生的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是因為，這對於我們雙方來說都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要請示魏先生的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們調查了米莎相關的情報，有一條情報指出，她的父親是切爾諾伯格的要人之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎的父親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我們也不知道，米莎究竟握有多少切爾諾伯格的資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是零，也可能是一百。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都不會知道有多少——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——除了米莎本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些切爾諾伯格的資訊，究竟含括哪些內容，我們也不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們推測整合運動的下一個目標是龍門——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，阻止整合運動對切爾諾伯格的利用是理所應當的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們並不想讓整合運動得到這名感染者，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"包括“有這樣一個感染者隨著逃難的人群進入了龍門”這條情報在內——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在你發現米莎之前，我也並不能確定這幾條情報的真實性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，就不能再拖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"必須在整合運動回到切爾諾伯格前阻止他們，救回米莎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，立刻進行整備！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"追緝這名感染者，是我們近衛局的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——同時，讓她落入整合運動之手，也是我們的失職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"比起共同追緝，我們需要羅德島清除整合運動的其他威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"交給你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要！別，別打我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"進入龍門之前難道沒想過自己的下場嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"全都關起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這批感染者。該死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這批。該死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......撤退的太快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看來整合運動也是分層次的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"留下來殿後的這些，都是些用來拖延時間的渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人拖住整個增援部隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"難道會是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！那邊還有殘存的整合運動成員！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"有埋伏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"去，去死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別惹惱我————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，我們還在龍門城範圍內！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"周圍的設施可能還有它用，請不要過度破壞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要你說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"至少別再把那些房間切成塊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可惡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這個女人，很難辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——難辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門難道是個允許你們隨便撒野的地方嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局，進攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]}]}
